{"seq":4,"slug":"container-queries","title":"容器查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/container-queries","wordCount":674,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"容器查询\">容器查询</h1><h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>传统的媒体查询基于<strong>视口</strong>尺寸做出响应，但在组件化开发中，同一个组件可能出现在不同宽度的容器中。容器查询（Container Queries）允许组件根据<strong>自身容器</strong>的尺寸来调整样式，实现真正的组件驱动设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>容器查询让样式以<strong>最近的查询容器</strong>（由 <code>container-type</code> 声明）为参照，而非视口：<code>container-type: inline-size</code> 建立宽度查询容器，<code>@container</code> 按容器尺寸切换样式，<code>cqw</code>/<code>cqi</code> 等单位则让子元素尺寸相对容器缩放——组件因此可以在不同容器中独立表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;传统媒体查询&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;基于视口宽度&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;全局响应式&quot;]&#10;    D[&quot;容器查询&quot;] --&gt; E[&quot;基于容器宽度&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;组件级响应式&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;同一组件,不同容器,不同表现&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"传统媒体查询\"] --&gt; B[\"基于视口宽度\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"全局响应式\"]\n    D[\"容器查询\"] --&gt; E[\"基于容器宽度\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"组件级响应式\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"同一组件,不同容器,不同表现\"]</pre><h2 id=\"基础用法\">基础用法</h2><h3 id=\"定义容器\">定义容器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card-wrapper {&#10;  container-type: inline-size;&#10;  container-name: card;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 简写 */&#10;.card-wrapper {&#10;  container: card / inline-size;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card-wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container-name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: card;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 简写 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card-wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: card / inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"查询容器\">查询容器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card {&#10;  display: grid;&#10;  gap: 1rem;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 容器宽度 ≥ 400px 时切换为水平布局 */&#10;@container card (min-width: 400px) {&#10;  .card {&#10;    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 容器宽度 ≥ 700px 时进一步增强 */&#10;@container card (min-width: 700px) {&#10;  .card {&#10;    grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;&#10;    gap: 2rem;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 容器宽度 ≥ 400px 时切换为水平布局 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card (min-width: 400px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 容器宽度 ≥ 700px 时进一步增强 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> card (min-width: 700px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    gap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"container-type-详解\">container-type 详解</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>可查询维度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>normal</code></td>\n<td>不作为查询容器（默认）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inline-size</code></td>\n<td>行内方向尺寸可查询</td>\n<td>宽度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>size</code></td>\n<td>行内和块方向尺寸都可查询</td>\n<td>宽度 + 高度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\"/* 只查询宽度（最常用） */&#10;.panel {&#10;  container-type: inline-size;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* 同时查询宽度和高度 */&#10;.viewport-like {&#10;  container-type: size;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 只查询宽度（最常用） */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.panel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 同时查询宽度和高度 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.viewport-like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>container-type: size</code> 要求容器有显式的高度，否则可能导致布局问题。绝大多数场景只需要 <code>inline-size</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"容器查询单位\">容器查询单位</h2><p>容器查询引入了新的相对单位：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cqw</code></td>\n<td>容器宽度的 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cqh</code></td>\n<td>容器高度的 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cqi</code></td>\n<td>容器行内尺寸的 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cqb</code></td>\n<td>容器块尺寸的 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cqmin</code></td>\n<td><code>cqi</code> 和 <code>cqb</code> 的较小值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cqmax</code></td>\n<td><code>cqi</code> 和 <code>cqb</code> 的较大值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".card-title {&#10;  font-size: clamp(1rem, 3cqi, 2rem);&#10;}&#10;&#10;.card-image {&#10;  height: 30cqi;&#10;  object-fit: cover;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card-title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  font-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">cqi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">rem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.card-image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">cqi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  object-fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"样式查询\">样式查询</h2><p>除了尺寸查询，容器查询还支持<strong>样式查询</strong>——根据容器的 CSS 自定义属性值来应用样式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".theme-wrapper {&#10;  --variant: default;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.theme-wrapper.featured {&#10;  --variant: featured;&#10;}&#10;&#10;@container style(--variant: featured) {&#10;  .card {&#10;    border-width: 2px;&#10;    border-color: currentColor;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  .card-title {&#10;    font-weight: 700;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.theme-wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --variant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.theme-wrapper.featured</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  --variant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: featured;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> style(--variant: featured) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    border-width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span