d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* 容器查询作为增强 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@supports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">container-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: inline-size) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .card-container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    container-type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  @container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (min-width: 400px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    .card</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      flex-direction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套容器\">嵌套容器</h2><p>容器查询支持嵌套——内部组件查询最近的容器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".page {&#10;  container: page / inline-size;&#10;}&#10;&#10;.sidebar {&#10;  container: sidebar / inline-size;&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* .widget 在 sidebar 中时查询 sidebar */&#10;@container sidebar (min-width: 300px) {&#10;  .widget {&#10;    display: grid;&#10;    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;/* .widget 直接在 page 中时查询 page */&#10;@container page (min-width: 1024px) {&#10;  .widget {&#10;    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> / inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.sidebar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: sidebar / inline-size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* .widget 在 sidebar 中时查询 sidebar */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sidebar (min-width: 300px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/* .widget 直接在 page 中时查询 page */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page (min-width: 1024px) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  .widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    grid-template-columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">repeat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 如果没有指定容器名称，<code>@container</code> 会匹配最近的祖先查询容器。使用命名容器可以更精确地控制查询目标。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>容器查询</strong>让组件根据自身容器尺寸响应，实现真正的组件级响应式设计</li>\n<li><strong><code>container-type: inline-size</code></strong> 是最常用的容器类型，只查询宽度</li>\n<li><strong>容器查询单位</strong>（<code>cqi</code>、<code>cqw</code>）让尺寸相对于容器而非视口</li>\n<li><strong>样式查询</strong>（<code>@container style(--variant: x)</code>）可根据自定义属性值调整样式</li>\n<li>容器查询与媒体查询互补，推荐使用<strong>渐进增强</strong>策略确保兼容性</li>\n<li><strong>嵌套容器</strong>支持复杂布局中不同层级的独立响应</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容器查询","id":"容器查询"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础用法","id":"基础用法"},{"level":3,"text":"定义容器","id":"定义容器"},{"level":3,"text":"查询容器","id":"查询容器"},{"level":2,"text":"container-type 详解","id":"container-type-详解"},{"level":2,"text":"容器查询单位","id":"容器查询单位"},{"level":2,"text":"样式查询","id":"样式查询"},{"level":2,"text":"组件驱动设计模式","id":"组件驱动设计模式"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应卡片","id":"自适应卡片"},{"level":3,"text":"自适应导航","id":"自适应导航"},{"level":2,"text":"容器查询 vs 媒体查询","id":"容器查询-vs-媒体查询"},{"level":3,"text":"渐进增强策略","id":"渐进增强策略"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套容器","id":"嵌套容器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"响应式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/layout-systems/responsive-design"},"next":{"title":"过渡与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/css-and-visual-engineering/animation/transitions-and-transforms"}}